    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_81d6f672bedb54fa052f",
      "document_start": 59,
      "document_end": 69,
      "text": "# 2）约束的分类;",
      "section_id": "section_10527db36f2f"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_b010ecd1eaf226d7c25d",
      "document_start": 70,
      "document_end": 102,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_10527db36f2f"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_cb3e67d2df495d56eb02",
      "document_start": 104,
      "document_end": 117,
      "text": "（2）几何约束和运动约束。",
      "section_id": "section_10527db36f2f"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_743ff16627d32ee5ec88",
      "document_start": 117,
      "document_end": 149,
      "text": "根据约束方程中是否含有坐标的导数，约束可分为几何约束和运动约束。",
      "section_id": "section_10527db36f2f"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_7ccd2395f3bd0090f920",
      "document_start": 149,
      "document_end": 191,
      "text": "几何约束是指约束只限制系统中各质点在空间的位置，即在约束方程中不显含质点坐标的导数。",
      "section_id": "section_10527db36f2f"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_dd5a8cc0c7a23c37357c",
      "document_start": 191,
      "document_end": 203,
      "text": "几何约束方程的一般形式为",
      "section_id": "section_10527db36f2f"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_2b4f0c6f931f2b1a7d1f",
      "document_start": 205,
      "document_end": 225,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 2;",
      "section_id": "section_10527db36f2f"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_639b0e500c14f85a0bbe",
      "document_start": 226,
      "document_end": 236,
      "text": "# 2）约束的分类;",
      "section_id": "section_10527db36f2f"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_eab87c1b92f316a0b5dc",
      "document_start": 237,
      "document_end": 269,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_10527db36f2f"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_d527d594c199194445ed",
      "document_start": 271,
      "document_end": 318,
      "text": "运动约束指约束对质点的运动参数（如速度、加速度等）进行限制，即在约束方程中显含质点坐标的导数。",
      "section_id": "section_10527db36f2f"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_98f32408de8d32d31f86",
      "document_start": 318,
      "document_end": 332,
      "text": "运动约束的约束方程一般形式为",
      "section_id": "section_10527db36f2f"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_8345da087e097692db3d",
      "document_start": 334,
      "document_end": 354,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 3;",
      "section_id": "section_10527db36f2f"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_4ddbbe0b0fb3a7da1582",
      "document_start": 355,
      "document_end": 365,
      "text": "# 2）约束的分类;",
      "section_id": "section_10527db36f2f"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_8231642adb6d9a1ff478",
      "document_start": 366,
      "document_end": 398,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_10527db36f2f"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_b14b570da6cfffc761d6",
      "document_start": 400,
      "document_end": 414,
      "text": "（3）完整约束和非完整约束。",
      "section_id": "section_10527db36f2f"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_a0ad219140340207bba5",
      "document_start": 414,
      "document_end": 466,
      "text": "几何约束和可积分为有限形式的运动约束（这两种约束的数学形式不显含质点坐标对时间的导数），统称为完整约束。",
      "section_id": "section_10527db36f2f"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_8578c1d7db819d076b41",
      "document_start": 466,
      "document_end": 489,
      "text": "完整约束的约束方程一般形式如式（2-3）所示。",
      "section_id": "section_10527db36f2f"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_93e716947967b3c52a6e",
      "document_start": 489,
      "document_end": 511,
      "text": "如前述的刚性单摆和纯滚动车轮均属于完整约束。",
      "section_id": "section_10527db36f2f"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_fc747aa120a7eb6c2da6",
      "document_start": 511,
      "document_end": 529,
      "text": "非完整约束就是指不可积分的运动约束。",
      "section_id": "section_10527db36f2f"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_e2e3713de908b1bdf219",
      "document_start": 529,
      "document_end": 553,
      "text": "非完整约束的约束方程一般形式如式（2-4）所示。",
      "section_id": "section_10527db36f2f"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_00fafcd0f98e45b8b8f6",
      "document_start": 555,
      "document_end": 575,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 4;",
      "section_id": "section_10527db36f2f"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_0ad033649924138b9d0b",
      "document_start": 576,
      "document_end": 586,
      "text": "# 2）约束的分类;",
      "section_id": "section_10527db36f2f"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_ed664658c4d7590f104f",
      "document_start": 587,
      "document_end": 619,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_10527db36f2f"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_3ab013e81e5ecef24914",
      "document_start": 621,
      "document_end": 655,
      "text": "非完整约束也可以按坐标求导的次数分为1阶非完整约束和高阶非完整约束。",
      "section_id": "section_10527db36f2f"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_fafd1d19330401c4bc6c",
      "document_start": 655,
      "document_end": 721,
      "text": "1阶非完整约束指方程式中只含有质点坐标对时间的1阶导数，而不含2阶或高阶导数，例如方程式（2-5）所表示的约束，就是1阶非完整约束。",
      "section_id": "section_10527db36f2f"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_78d134e946b4bf60ced9",
      "document_start": 721,
      "document_end": 752,
      "text": "若方程式中含有2阶或高阶导数，那么这种约束称为高阶非完整约束。",
      "section_id": "section_10527db36f2f"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_36186002569d2b1642b8",
      "document_start": 752,
      "document_end": 778,
      "text": "工程中经常遇到的非完整约束，大多数是1阶非完整约束。",
      "section_id": "section_10527db36f2f"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_84c7e1ba7cfae9766734",
      "document_start": 780,
      "document_end": 800,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 5;",
      "section_id": "section_10527db36f2f"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_1a6a4ee7a30fe1a2901f",
      "document_start": 801,
      "document_end": 811,
      "text": "# 2）约束的分类;",
      "section_id": "section_10527db36f2f"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_33f1aa2dbad061791f97",
      "document_start": 812,
      "document_end": 844,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_10527db36f2f"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_e35bb552652b7660cb94",
      "document_start": 846,
      "document_end": 880,
      "text": "一个力学系统，如果仅受到完整约束的作用，那么，这个系统称为完整系统。",
      "section_id": "section_10527db36f2f"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_f16a8d7d8c5e59cf2501",
      "document_start": 880,
      "document_end": 907,
      "text": "如果受到的约束有非完整约束，则这个系统称为非完整系统。",
      "section_id": "section_10527db36f2f"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_11170884d07fc465787e",
      "document_start": 907,
      "document_end": 945,
      "text": "求解完整系统和非完整系统的力学问题，两者在方法上是不一样的，后者要困难得多。",
      "section_id": "section_10527db36f2f"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_c248d694bf391f4164bb",
      "document_start": 947,
      "document_end": 967,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 6;",
      "section_id": "section_10527db36f2f"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_8afc746f5cbdbeec9d05",
      "document_start": 968,
      "document_end": 978,
      "text": "# 2）约束的分类;",
      "section_id": "section_10527db36f2f"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_fe32afda2fc5277c35db",
      "document_start": 979,
      "document_end": 1011,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_10527db36f2f"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_5a4b8ae1740ba593bd44",
      "document_start": 1013,
      "document_end": 1026,
      "text": "（4）单面约束和双面约束。",
      "section_id": "section_10527db36f2f"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_b2be75ffeb868607854f",
      "document_start": 1026,
      "document_end": 1079,
      "text": "若质点系虽然受到约束，但在某些方向可以脱离约束的限制，则这类约束称为单面约束（又称可解约束、非固执约束）。",
      "section_id": "section_10527db36f2f"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_13aa2c77f4bc264b314f",
      "document_start": 1079,
      "document_end": 1091,
      "text": "单面约束方程的一般形式为",
      "section_id": "section_10527db36f2f"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_4a34e2712e0db25aa435",
      "document_start": 1093,
      "document_end": 1113,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 7;",
      "section_id": "section_10527db36f2f"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_9ad86f44712a645c89c6",
      "document_start": 1114,
      "document_end": 1124,
      "text": "# 2）约束的分类;",
      "section_id": "section_10527db36f2f"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_cfff0f7906fa51a4ff47",
      "document_start": 1125,
      "document_end": 1157,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_10527db36f2f"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_aefd0836546edd249a1c",
      "document_start": 1159,
      "document_end": 1193,
      "text": "单面约束的力学问题，一般都可以分为双面约束和自由系统两种情况来处理。",
      "section_id": "section_10527db36f2f"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_8e93288cbc6ccfdb6538",
      "document_start": 1193,
      "document_end": 1217,
      "text": "当系统在约束面上运动时，按双面约束情况进行研究；",
      "section_id": "section_10527db36f2f"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_15000b11a5ae1eb86280",
      "document_start": 1217,
      "document_end": 1252,
      "text": "一旦系统脱离了约束的界面，则把脱离约束界面以后的运动当作自由运动处理。",
      "section_id": "section_10527db36f2f"
    }
  ],
